{"id":"steam-1360210","steam":1360210,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Artificial Life 2061: Cybersys - Diva Of The VRworld, Babel Project: \"Kodota Komori 1416\" [Made by: Joseph Sanz]","summary":"50% Visual Novel + 50% JRPG. This game is like an FF of Atry Story. Explore the digital world! Exciting turn-based combat, deep and realistic storyline. Explore the area in a top-view mode. Perfect for beginners and experts alike. Discover how the creator of a robot singer will change our destiny.","about":"JRPG turn-based battles alternate with a deep and realistic storyline that will keep you on the edge of your seat and make you contemplate near-future world problems and challenges.\r\n\n• \nPlay free the start of the game in the Demo\n\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGet ready for an adventure set in our near future! The game is fully illustrated with over 1000 images and poses, and it features original music created by the game’s developer and from other great artists (including a Miku composer).\r\n\r\nExplore both the virtual world inside computers and a dystopian dark future in the real world, with each situation and dialogue carrying depth and meaning.\r\n\r\n\n• \nGameplay, menus and turn-based combat similar to FF 6 game\n\n \r\n\n• \nRomance and universe feel similar to Atry game and Anime\n\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\n• Thanks to your wishlist support recently included more songs by: \n \r\n>Mafi Michel - Professional Opera Singer  >AJ Music - Independent Vocaloid Producer\r\n>Kekkan - VIrtual Singers Producer            >City GIrl - Popular Electronic Music Producer\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nRecent upgrades were made possible by your support!\r\n1 - More songs.\r\n2 - Improved graphics in some scenes.\r\n3 - Characters speak in battles.\r\n4 - Working to improve the Interface.\r\n5 - Ruby the new playable character.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1360210/library_600x900.jpg?t=1788733968","coverFallback":"htt